  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Rage taps into the life force of the World Tree. You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Vitality Surge.</strong> When you activate your Rage, you gain Temporary Hit Points equal to your Barbarian level.</p><p><strong>Life-Giving Force.</strong> At the start of each of your turns while your Rage is active, you can choose another creature within 10 feet of you to gain Temporary Hit Points equal to the total of a number of d6s equal to your Rage Damage bonus. Any of these Temporary Hit Points left when your Rage ends vanish.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
